        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style='min-height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;background:#ffffff;font-family:system-ui'><header style='padding:48px 40px 20px'><div style='font:800 12px/1 system-ui;letter-spacing:.18em;color:#0f766e;margin-bottom:14px'>NODE CLASS · example-note</div><h1 style='margin:0 0 12px;font:850 40px/1.05 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>Example Note</h1><p style='margin:0;max-width:44ch;font:400 19px/1.5 system-ui;color:#475569'>A short note with a title, a body and a status. This is a specimen: change it, or start a new class from this template.</p></header><section style='padding:24px 40px'><h2 style='margin:0 0 12px;font:800 24px/1.2 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>Specimen</h2><div style='display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:flex-start;flex-wrap:wrap'><div style='width:420px;height:260px'><div style='width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;padding:24px;border-radius:22px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-family:system-ui;color:#0f172a;overflow:hidden'><div style='font:800 24px/1.2 system-ui;margin-bottom:12px'>A title</div><div style='margin-bottom:10px'><div style='font:700 11px/1.4 system-ui;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#64748b'>Body</div><div style='font:400 15px/1.5 system-ui;color:#334155'>What the note says.</div></div><div style='margin-bottom:10px'><div style='font:700 11px/1.4 system-ui;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#64748b'>Status</div><div style='font:400 15px/1.5 system-ui;color:#334155'>open</div></div></div></div><div style='width:214.2857142857143px;height:142.85714285714286px'><div style='width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;padding:20px;border-radius:20px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-family:system-ui;color:#0f172a;overflow:hidden'><div style='font:800 24px/1.2 system-ui;margin-bottom:12px'>A title</div><div style='margin-bottom:10px'><div style='font:700 11px/1.4 system-ui;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#64748b'>Body</div><div style='font:400 15px/1.5 system-ui;color:#334155'>What the note says.</div></div><div style='margin-bottom:10px'><div style='font:700 11px/1.4 system-ui;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#64748b'>Status</div><div style='font:400 15px/1.5 system-ui;color:#334155'>open</div></div></div></div><div style='width:120px;height:110px'><div style='width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;padding:16px;border-radius:18px;background:#ede9fe;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-family:system-ui;color:#0f172a;overflow:hidden'><div style='color:#7c3aed;font-size:22px;font-weight:800'>E</div><div style='font:800 15px/1.2 system-ui;margin-top:8px'>A title</div></div></div></div></section><section style='padding:24px 40px'><h2 style='margin:0 0 12px;font:800 24px/1.2 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>Settings</h2><dl style='margin:0;max-width:560px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:max-content 1fr;gap:8px 24px;padding:18px 22px;border-radius:14px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0'><dt style='font:700 13px/1.5 system-ui;color:#64748b'>Key</dt><dd style='margin:0;font:500 15px/1.5 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>example-note</dd><dt style='font:700 13px/1.5 system-ui;color:#64748b'>Label</dt><dd style='margin:0;font:500 15px/1.5 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>Example Note</dd><dt style='font:700 13px/1.5 system-ui;color:#64748b'>Meaning</dt><dd style='margin:0;font:500 15px/1.5 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>A short note with a title, a body and a status. This is a specimen: change it, or start a new class from this template.</dd><dt style='font:700 13px/1.5 system-ui;color:#64748b'>Size</dt><dd style='margin:0;font:500 15px/1.5 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>420 by 260</dd><dt style='font:700 13px/1.5 system-ui;color:#64748b'>Glyph</dt><dd style='margin:0;font:500 15px/1.5 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>Article</dd><dt style='font:700 13px/1.5 system-ui;color:#64748b'>Required fields</dt><dd style='margin:0;font:500 15px/1.5 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>title</dd></dl></section><section style='padding:24px 40px'><h2 style='margin:0 0 12px;font:800 24px/1.2 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>Fields</h2><table style='border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font:400 14px/1.5 system-ui'><thead><tr><th style='text-align:left;padding:6px 12px 6px 0;font:700 12px/1.4 system-ui;color:#64748b;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0'>Name</th><th style='text-align:left;padding:6px 12px 6px 0;font:700 12px/1.4 system-ui;color:#64748b;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0'>Type</th><th style='text-align:left;padding:6px 12px 6px 0;font:700 12px/1.4 system-ui;color:#64748b;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0'>Required</th><th style='text-align:left;padding:6px 12px 6px 0;font:700 12px/1.4 system-ui;color:#64748b;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0'>Default</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px 6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;color:#0f172a'>title</td><td style='padding:6px 12px 6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;color:#0f172a'>text</td><td style='padding:6px 12px 6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;color:#0f172a'>yes</td><td style='padding:6px 12px 6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;color:#0f172a'>A title</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px 6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;color:#0f172a'>body</td><td style='padding:6px 12px 6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;color:#0f172a'>multiline</td><td style='padding:6px 12px 6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;color:#0f172a'>no</td><td style='padding:6px 12px 6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;color:#0f172a'>What the note says.</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px 6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;color:#0f172a'>status</td><td style='padding:6px 12px 6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;color:#0f172a'>select (open, done, dropped)</td><td style='padding:6px 12px 6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;color:#0f172a'>no</td><td style='padding:6px 12px 6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;color:#0f172a'>open</td></tr></tbody></table></section><section style='padding:24px 40px'><h2 style='margin:0 0 12px;font:800 24px/1.2 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>Ports</h2><table style='border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font:400 14px/1.5 system-ui'><thead><tr><th style='text-align:left;padding:6px 12px 6px 0;font:700 12px/1.4 system-ui;color:#64748b;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0'>Id</th><th style='text-align:left;padding:6px 12px 6px 0;font:700 12px/1.4 system-ui;color:#64748b;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0'>Direction</th><th style='text-align:left;padding:6px 12px 6px 0;font:700 12px/1.4 system-ui;color:#64748b;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0'>Side</th><th style='text-align:left;padding:6px 12px 6px 0;font:700 12px/1.4 system-ui;color:#64748b;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0'>Accepts</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px 6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;color:#0f172a'>root</td><td style='padding:6px 12px 6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;color:#0f172a'>bidirectional</td><td style='padding:6px 12px 6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;color:#0f172a'>top at 0.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px 6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;color:#0f172a'>any edge</td></tr></tbody></table></section><section style='padding:24px 40px'><h2 style='margin:0 0 12px;font:800 24px/1.2 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>Events</h2><table style='border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font:400 14px/1.5 system-ui'><thead><tr><th style='text-align:left;padding:6px 12px 6px 0;font:700 12px/1.4 system-ui;color:#64748b;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0'>Event</th><th style='text-align:left;padding:6px 12px 6px 0;font:700 12px/1.4 system-ui;color:#64748b;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0'>Label</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px 6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;color:#0f172a'>node.changed</td><td style='padding:6px 12px 6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;color:#0f172a'>Example Note changed</td></tr></tbody></table></section><section style='padding:24px 40px'><h2 style='margin:0 0 12px;font:800 24px/1.2 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>Description and rationale</h2><p style='margin:0 0 12px;max-width:60ch;font:400 16px/1.6 system-ui;color:#334155'>Say what this class is in a sentence or two, in the words of someone deciding whether to use it. The one-line meaning at the top of the page comes from the Meaning property; this is the fuller version.</p><p style='margin:0 0 12px;max-width:60ch;font:400 16px/1.6 system-ui;color:#334155'>Then say why it exists: what it holds that an existing class does not.</p></section><section style='padding:24px 40px'><h2 style='margin:0 0 12px;font:800 24px/1.2 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>Evidence</h2><p style='margin:0 0 12px;max-width:60ch;font:400 16px/1.6 system-ui;color:#334155'>Say what shows it is right: where it is used, what depends on it, what was tried before it. Point at real graphs and real files.</p></section></div>"
        },
        "renderShape": {
          "kind": "html"
        }
      }
    },
